1
00:00:15,360 --> 00:00:16,400
What is she playing?

2
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:17,080
The Butterfly Lovers.

3
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:19,640
Such a classic.

4
00:00:33,080 --> 00:00:34,480
Liang Xiaoyu is playing the piano.

5
00:00:34,480 --> 00:00:38,140
(Zhao Xilun and Sun Qimeng
return to the Signal House)

6
00:00:40,680 --> 00:00:41,360
Thanks.

7
00:00:41,360 --> 00:00:41,760
No problem.

8
00:00:43,160 --> 00:00:43,960
Hello.

9
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:44,640
Hi.

10
00:00:44,640 --> 00:00:46,120
Hi, babe.

11
00:00:46,440 --> 00:00:48,280
You two are wearing
such matching colors today.

12
00:00:48,880 --> 00:00:49,560
Thanks.

13
00:00:50,160 --> 00:00:51,400
Did you have fun?

14
00:00:51,840 --> 00:00:52,640
Yeah.

15
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:54,400
It was pretty fun.

16
00:00:54,400 --> 00:00:55,800
I'll put my stuff down first.

17
00:00:57,280 --> 00:00:58,320
You look handsome today too.

18
00:00:58,320 --> 00:00:59,000
Thanks.

19
00:00:59,000 --> 00:00:59,800
You look pretty too.

20
00:01:00,240 --> 00:01:00,600
Thanks.

21
00:01:00,600 --> 00:01:01,760
I need to go upstairs.

22
00:01:01,760 --> 00:01:02,960
I'll head up for a bit.

23
00:01:03,560 --> 00:01:05,160
Meng, I'll head upstairs first.

24
00:01:05,680 --> 00:01:06,800
Okay.

25
00:01:07,400 --> 00:01:08,520
Meng, shall we

26
00:01:08,520 --> 00:01:09,480
take some photos together later?

27
00:01:09,480 --> 00:01:10,280
Sure.

28
00:01:22,760 --> 00:01:24,360
Hello.

29
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:28,240
I brought my dog out today.

30
00:01:28,600 --> 00:01:30,440
I just got out of bed.

31
00:01:31,760 --> 00:01:33,120
I took a nap earlier.

32
00:01:33,200 --> 00:01:34,320
So you didn't go out today?

33
00:01:34,320 --> 00:01:35,120
No, I didn't.

34
00:01:35,960 --> 00:01:36,640
He doesn't know.

35
00:01:40,220 --> 00:01:41,920
Today, Meng and I

36
00:01:41,920 --> 00:01:42,960
went to...

37
00:01:42,960 --> 00:01:44,040
We went to a park.

38
00:01:44,040 --> 00:01:45,520
And I brought my dog along.

39
00:01:45,520 --> 00:01:46,520
It was pretty fun.

40
00:01:46,770 --> 00:01:47,720
Have you eaten?

41
00:01:47,720 --> 00:01:49,200
Yeah. I cooked for myself.

42
00:01:49,620 --> 00:01:51,780
(Looks toward the door)

43
00:01:52,940 --> 00:01:54,800
(Gets up) He can hear everything.

44
00:01:54,800 --> 00:01:57,200
He's right outside the door.

45
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:58,200
He can hear us, right?

46
00:01:58,200 --> 00:01:59,000
Yeah.

47
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:00,320
Maybe we should go outside.

48
00:02:02,480 --> 00:02:03,680
No.

49
00:02:03,680 --> 00:02:04,760
It's just that I have

50
00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:06,000
mixed feelings.

51
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:08,440
I'm feeling a little dizzy now.

52
00:02:08,920 --> 00:02:10,760
I'm just a little tired.

53
00:02:11,160 --> 00:02:12,320
He's here.

54
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:13,360
Chen Hewen...

55
00:02:14,040 --> 00:02:15,920
He hasn't seen this many people before.

56
00:02:21,660 --> 00:02:23,300
(Stops)

57
00:02:23,580 --> 00:02:25,170
(Looks)

58
00:02:25,170 --> 00:02:26,220
Oh my god.

59
00:02:29,720 --> 00:02:30,840
He left?

60
00:02:33,740 --> 00:02:35,460
(Looks down)

61
00:02:35,480 --> 00:02:36,280
She's disappointed.

62
00:02:49,680 --> 00:02:50,760
How about...

63
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:52,400
Why did he go back to his spot again?

64
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:55,040
I was going to ask you
to go rock climbing.

65
00:02:55,240 --> 00:02:56,160
But,

66
00:02:56,160 --> 00:02:58,400
I saw Yu Yang and Fang over there.

67
00:02:58,880 --> 00:03:00,560
My secret spot

68
00:03:00,560 --> 00:03:02,920
has been discovered.

69
00:03:09,600 --> 00:03:11,000
Is he writing in his diary?

70
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:12,200
Could he possibly be

71
00:03:12,200 --> 00:03:13,520
writing someone a note or something?

72
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:20,280
What did he write?

73
00:03:22,440 --> 00:03:24,480
I apologize for the things I've done

74
00:03:24,480 --> 00:03:27,480
without considering your feelings.

75
00:03:27,480 --> 00:03:28,360
But,

76
00:03:28,360 --> 00:03:30,600
have you considered my feelings?

77
00:03:30,960 --> 00:03:32,120
I think

78
00:03:32,120 --> 00:03:33,600
Chen Hewen is upset too.

79
00:03:33,800 --> 00:03:34,760
He's been keeping it

80
00:03:34,760 --> 00:03:36,160
bottled up.

81
00:03:41,960 --> 00:03:42,800
What's wrong

82
00:03:42,800 --> 00:03:44,840
with giving in a little
in a relationship?

83
00:03:45,640 --> 00:03:46,560
Yeah.

84
00:03:46,560 --> 00:03:47,920
They're still angry.

85
00:03:47,920 --> 00:03:49,920
A small misunderstanding
turns into a big one.

86
00:03:51,600 --> 00:03:52,600
I originally wanted

87
00:03:53,160 --> 00:03:54,000
to bring some food back.

88
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:55,360
But today, I really

89
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:56,880
spent the whole time driving,

90
00:03:56,880 --> 00:03:58,520
so I didn't get a chance
to buy any food.

91
00:04:23,660 --> 00:04:26,020
(Eye mask from Zhao Xilun)

92
00:04:27,380 --> 00:04:28,740
(Checking out)

93
00:04:31,300 --> 00:04:33,340
(Puts it down)

94
00:04:57,080 --> 00:04:59,040
This is a photo of the two of them.

95
00:05:02,480 --> 00:05:03,520
She put it down.

96
00:05:14,800 --> 00:05:15,960
She picked it up again.

97
00:05:20,960 --> 00:05:22,360
It still hurts a little.

98
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:32,960
Liang Xiaoyu...

99
00:05:33,880 --> 00:05:34,680
What happened?

100
00:05:34,800 --> 00:05:36,960
How did something suddenly appear here?

101
00:05:37,160 --> 00:05:37,960
What?

102
00:05:38,360 --> 00:05:39,440
This one.

103
00:05:39,440 --> 00:05:40,640
I brought this back.

104
00:05:42,880 --> 00:05:43,720
I didn't even notice it.

105
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:44,960
It suddenly appeared after I

106
00:05:44,960 --> 00:05:46,080
came back from the bathroom.

107
00:05:46,080 --> 00:05:46,960
Yeah, I conjured it up.

108
00:05:47,280 --> 00:05:47,720
I just

109
00:05:47,720 --> 00:05:48,760
- came back,
- I conjured it up.

110
00:05:48,760 --> 00:05:49,320
and you called me.

111
00:05:49,320 --> 00:05:50,640
Then, this thing suddenly appeared.

112
00:05:50,760 --> 00:05:51,600
That's amazing.

113
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:52,640
What did you guys do today?

114
00:05:52,640 --> 00:05:53,920
We played tennis today.

115
00:05:53,920 --> 00:05:55,560
And what food did you have?

116
00:05:55,560 --> 00:05:56,360
We had

117
00:05:56,360 --> 00:05:57,760
Western food.

118
00:05:57,760 --> 00:05:58,560
Western food?

119
00:05:58,560 --> 00:06:00,400
Steak and shrimp.

120
00:06:00,800 --> 00:06:03,240
So much happened to me today.

121
00:06:05,560 --> 00:06:07,040
After thinking it over,

122
00:06:07,040 --> 00:06:08,800
I told him

123
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:10,480
that we should just be friends.

124
00:06:12,700 --> 00:06:14,700
(Opens arms)

125
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:16,720
Yes, Liang Xiaoyu.

126
00:06:17,360 --> 00:06:19,000
You're amazing.

127
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:21,120
I just feel like he's been
avoiding me, and I don't

128
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:22,640
seem to be getting any response
from him.

129
00:06:22,640 --> 00:06:23,600
So I decided to let it go.

130
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:25,720
I feel like I'm pressuring him

131
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:26,800
by taking the initiative.

132
00:06:28,280 --> 00:06:30,040
So I thought I might as well let it go.

133
00:06:31,560 --> 00:06:32,520
Yesterday,

134
00:06:32,520 --> 00:06:34,400
I really overthought everything.

135
00:06:35,200 --> 00:06:36,560
Why did you think so much?

136
00:06:38,560 --> 00:06:39,920
I felt

137
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:40,640
really upset

138
00:06:40,640 --> 00:06:43,000
after the event ended.

139
00:06:43,560 --> 00:06:44,320
Yeah.

140
00:06:44,320 --> 00:06:45,960
I feel like always being

141
00:06:47,640 --> 00:06:49,320
the one to take the initiative

142
00:06:49,320 --> 00:06:50,720
isn't that great.

143
00:06:51,800 --> 00:06:52,520
No,

144
00:06:52,520 --> 00:06:54,640
I don't think
there's anything wrong with that.

145
00:06:57,160 --> 00:06:58,880
Then I thought about it for a long time.

146
00:06:59,360 --> 00:07:01,920
I figured everything out on the rooftop.

147
00:07:03,960 --> 00:07:06,160
Luckily, we had this date.

148
00:07:06,160 --> 00:07:08,400
Otherwise, I wouldn't have known

149
00:07:08,400 --> 00:07:09,360
how to tell him.

150
00:07:14,840 --> 00:07:16,290
Geez.

151
00:07:21,280 --> 00:07:22,040
Yeah.

152
00:07:22,380 --> 00:07:24,780
(Moves closer)

153
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:25,440
Yeah.

154
00:07:26,400 --> 00:07:27,280
Many things

155
00:07:27,280 --> 00:07:28,600
are flashing

156
00:07:28,600 --> 00:07:30,280
through my mind now.

157
00:07:31,040 --> 00:07:31,920
Like what?

158
00:07:33,880 --> 00:07:34,600
I don't know

159
00:07:34,600 --> 00:07:35,600
how I'm supposed

160
00:07:35,600 --> 00:07:36,680
to stay here anymore.

161
00:07:36,680 --> 00:07:38,320
Everyone is paired up.

162
00:07:40,340 --> 00:07:41,860
(Reaches out)

163
00:07:42,240 --> 00:07:43,200
You...

164
00:07:43,200 --> 00:07:43,920
You have me.

165
00:07:43,920 --> 00:07:44,840
I'll be with you.

166
00:07:46,680 --> 00:07:48,680
Female friendships are truly wonderful.

167
00:07:54,960 --> 00:07:55,880
If anyone asks,

168
00:07:55,880 --> 00:07:57,160
(Cui Yihang and Sun Bohan
return to the Signal House)

169
00:07:57,160 --> 00:07:59,280
shall we tell them about this?

170
00:07:59,280 --> 00:08:00,080
Don't say anything.

171
00:08:00,080 --> 00:08:01,160
I think so too.

172
00:08:01,160 --> 00:08:03,240
Just say something unexpected came up.

173
00:08:04,360 --> 00:08:05,560
That's really nice.

174
00:08:05,560 --> 00:08:06,520
So nice of them.

175
00:08:08,520 --> 00:08:09,320
Hi, guys.

176
00:08:09,760 --> 00:08:11,160
Hello.

177
00:08:14,680 --> 00:08:15,720
They went to fly kites.

178
00:08:15,720 --> 00:08:16,600
They went kite-flying.

179
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:20,240
What about the other two?

180
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:22,200
Well,

181
00:08:22,200 --> 00:08:24,240
something came up.

182
00:08:24,240 --> 00:08:25,920
The fact that they revealed nothing
really gets me.

183
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:27,520
I really like that.

184
00:08:27,520 --> 00:08:28,360
Very gentlemanly.

185
00:08:28,360 --> 00:08:29,760
I think that's very mature.

186
00:08:30,680 --> 00:08:32,040
Hello.

187
00:08:32,040 --> 00:08:33,320
Did you come back together?

188
00:08:35,040 --> 00:08:37,000
They don't want
to ruin everyone else's mood either.

189
00:08:39,120 --> 00:08:39,720
You guys...

190
00:08:39,720 --> 00:08:40,560
We'll head upstairs first.

191
00:08:41,120 --> 00:08:41,960
You guys go ahead.

192
00:08:46,960 --> 00:08:48,040
They're finally back.

193
00:08:48,040 --> 00:08:49,520
Who?

194
00:08:49,520 --> 00:08:50,120
Probably

195
00:08:50,120 --> 00:08:52,240
our roommates.

196
00:08:52,640 --> 00:08:53,440
Are they here?

197
00:08:53,440 --> 00:08:53,920
Are they?

198
00:08:53,920 --> 00:08:54,720
They're back.

199
00:08:54,720 --> 00:08:55,240
Where?

200
00:08:55,240 --> 00:08:55,840
Downstairs.

201
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:56,920
Hey.

202
00:08:57,240 --> 00:08:58,000
So pretty.

203
00:09:00,160 --> 00:09:01,800
You guys look amazing today.

204
00:09:02,280 --> 00:09:03,320
You guys went together?

205
00:09:04,520 --> 00:09:06,040
Were all four of you together today?

206
00:09:06,040 --> 00:09:06,440
In pairs.

207
00:09:06,440 --> 00:09:07,440
No.

208
00:09:07,440 --> 00:09:08,960
Something came up for them.

209
00:09:09,120 --> 00:09:09,800
Yeah.

210
00:09:09,800 --> 00:09:10,440
Seriously?

211
00:09:10,880 --> 00:09:12,160
I'm heading back.

212
00:09:12,680 --> 00:09:13,840
They're okay, right?

213
00:09:14,480 --> 00:09:16,040
Nothing...

214
00:09:16,040 --> 00:09:17,120
nothing serious, right?

215
00:09:17,120 --> 00:09:17,800
Something came up.

216
00:09:17,800 --> 00:09:18,840
They might have to...

217
00:09:18,840 --> 00:09:19,320
I don't know.

218
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:20,200
Nothing else. Yeah.

219
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:21,360
It's nothing serious.

220
00:09:21,360 --> 00:09:21,960
I'm heading back.

221
00:09:21,960 --> 00:09:23,440
Go ahead.

222
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:27,160
But they look really down.

223
00:09:27,920 --> 00:09:29,040
A little.

224
00:09:36,520 --> 00:09:38,920
Sun Bohan and Cui Yihang seem

225
00:09:38,920 --> 00:09:40,760
kind of down.

226
00:09:41,480 --> 00:09:42,600
Just open the curtains.

227
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:43,400
Yeah.

228
00:09:58,360 --> 00:09:59,320
Looking at photos.

229
00:10:17,400 --> 00:10:18,320
He's worried sick.

230
00:10:32,940 --> 00:10:35,540
(City date invitation card from Xing)
The invitation card.

231
00:10:37,960 --> 00:10:38,720
What's up, Sun Bohan?

232
00:10:38,720 --> 00:10:39,360
That smile...

233
00:10:39,360 --> 00:10:40,680
Looks like he's smiling through tears.

234
00:10:40,680 --> 00:10:41,320
How was your day?

235
00:10:41,320 --> 00:10:42,400
Where'd you go?

236
00:10:43,040 --> 00:10:45,160
We went to a dog park today.

237
00:10:45,160 --> 00:10:46,560
I brought my dog along.

238
00:10:47,400 --> 00:10:48,600
Did you guys...

239
00:10:48,600 --> 00:10:49,440
You...

240
00:10:49,440 --> 00:10:51,080
You didn't go?

241
00:10:51,320 --> 00:10:52,760
No, something came up.

242
00:10:53,840 --> 00:10:54,640
They...

243
00:10:55,480 --> 00:10:56,760
Yeah, uh...

244
00:10:56,760 --> 00:10:57,680
Something with Xing.

245
00:10:59,120 --> 00:11:00,000
She's okay, right?

246
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:01,800
She's fine.

247
00:11:03,880 --> 00:11:05,840
So where'd you guys go?

248
00:11:07,400 --> 00:11:08,000
What?

249
00:11:13,560 --> 00:11:14,840
He couldn't hold it in.

250
00:11:15,020 --> 00:11:15,900
Oh my God.

251
00:11:18,440 --> 00:11:19,720
He tried, but he couldn't.

252
00:11:19,720 --> 00:11:20,600
You...

253
00:11:20,600 --> 00:11:21,640
What's wrong?

254
00:11:21,640 --> 00:11:22,120
What happened?

255
00:11:28,400 --> 00:11:29,840
It's okay.

256
00:11:54,640 --> 00:11:55,440
It's okay.

257
00:11:56,320 --> 00:11:57,200
I don't know what happened.

258
00:11:57,200 --> 00:11:58,160
But if you...

259
00:11:58,160 --> 00:11:59,480
If you don't wanna talk, don't.

260
00:11:59,480 --> 00:12:00,080
Um...

261
00:12:00,080 --> 00:12:00,720
It's okay.

262
00:12:04,920 --> 00:12:06,240
Take a minute to calm down.

263
00:12:12,480 --> 00:12:13,480
Need more tissues?

264
00:12:13,680 --> 00:12:14,720
No, I'm fine.

265
00:12:14,720 --> 00:12:15,600
I'm okay now.

266
00:12:19,160 --> 00:12:22,480
Okay, take some time to process it.

267
00:12:34,600 --> 00:12:35,320
I can't.

268
00:12:35,320 --> 00:12:36,720
Seeing him hurts now.

269
00:12:37,160 --> 00:12:38,800
- What do I do?
- I get you.

270
00:12:40,080 --> 00:12:42,120
Let's ask Sun Bohan what's going on.

271
00:12:47,720 --> 00:12:48,480
Look at him.

272
00:12:48,480 --> 00:12:49,400
What's he doing?

273
00:12:49,400 --> 00:12:50,680
What's he up to?

274
00:12:50,680 --> 00:12:52,120
Chen Hewen's eavesdropping.

275
00:12:52,120 --> 00:12:53,440
- Can't you see him?
- Look at Chen Hewen's pose.

276
00:12:55,280 --> 00:12:56,800
Hello? Anyone there?

277
00:12:57,560 --> 00:12:58,200
Who is it?

278
00:13:00,200 --> 00:13:01,040
It's Chen Hewen.

279
00:13:03,360 --> 00:13:04,200
I'm right here.

280
00:13:04,720 --> 00:13:06,280
He's "trapped himself" in there.

281
00:13:06,360 --> 00:13:07,080
Where are you?

282
00:13:07,080 --> 00:13:07,880
Right here.

283
00:13:14,680 --> 00:13:15,480
Hello.

284
00:13:15,680 --> 00:13:16,360
Then I'll...

285
00:13:18,800 --> 00:13:20,360
He's crazy!

286
00:13:20,360 --> 00:13:21,360
I'm leaving.

287
00:13:24,880 --> 00:13:25,800
Come here.

288
00:13:25,800 --> 00:13:26,960
This is hilarious.

289
00:13:26,960 --> 00:13:28,080
You're seriously crazy.

290
00:13:29,000 --> 00:13:31,040
It's like you're running
a little store here.

291
00:13:31,040 --> 00:13:31,400
Hello,

292
00:13:31,400 --> 00:13:32,400
