293
00:13:32,400 --> 00:13:33,960
Let's go find Sun Bohan first.

294
00:13:33,960 --> 00:13:35,760
We'll come buy something later.

295
00:13:36,400 --> 00:13:38,320
Then the store is closed for now.

296
00:13:38,650 --> 00:13:39,520
Oh my God.

297
00:13:40,160 --> 00:13:41,120
He's so funny.

298
